{"ref":"character:minnah-mannarah","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Minnah Mannarah is a secret playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.7.2. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Bloody_Tear.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:bloody-tear"}," ",{"t":"Bloody Tear","r":"weapon:bloody-tear"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["9 June 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Minnah"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["GRAZIELLA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Bloody_Tear.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:bloody-tear"}," ",{"t":"Bloody Tear","r":"weapon:bloody-tear"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Deal with the consequence of stealing cheese from the ",{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},"."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 666"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["150"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["0.50"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["-70%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Deal with the consequence of stealing cheese from the ",{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},".\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining the ",{"t":"Yellow Sign","r":"relic:yellow-sign"},", the player must start a run in ",{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"}," and collect the ",{"i":"Sprite-Cheese.png","w":24,"h":24}," Cheese, which is visible on the map as a ",{"i":"Sprite-Floor_Chicken.png","w":24,"h":24}," Floor Chicken. It can also be attracted using ",{"i":"Sprite-Mad_Groove_(VIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:mad-groove-viii"}," ",{"t":"Mad Groove (VIII)","r":"arcana:mad-groove-viii"},". Upon collecting the Cheese, seven large ",{"i":"Sprite-Werewolf.png","w":23,"h":24}," Werewolves will spawn in a circle around the player. Defeating all of the Werewolves unlocks Minnah Mannarah as a playable character."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Minnah Mannarah can be bought for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 666, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Minnah Mannarah can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"foldinthecheese\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Minnah starts with +50 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +0.5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", and -70% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},". She gains +10% Might every three levels until 24. Her stats change every minute similar to some Arcanas. Might, ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}," are on a cycle; when Duration, Area, and Cooldown are multiplied by 2, Might and Projectile Speed are divided by 2, and vice versa."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Might"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-2"]},{"c":["-70%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3-5"]},{"c":["-60%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["6-8"]},{"c":["-50%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["9-11"]},{"c":["-40%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["12-14"]},{"c":["-30%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["15-17"]},{"c":["-20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["18-20"]},{"c":["-10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["21+"]},{"c":["0%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The stat changes may seem complicated but it is not random. She stays at the maximum or minimum bonuses most of the time so Minnah has two modes:"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Big ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", long ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", slow ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", and weaker."]},{"c":["Small Area, low Duration and Cooldown, fast Projectile Speed, and stronger."]}]}},{"c":["Minnah does not benefit from the stat oscillation from ",{"t":"Chaos in the Dark Night (V)","r":"arcana:chaos-in-the-dark-night-v"},", ",{"t":"Lost & Found Painting (XVII)","r":"arcana:lost-found-painting-xvii"}," and ",{"t":"Boogaloo of Illusions (XVIII)","r":"arcana:boogaloo-of-illusions-xviii"},", as they require the character to not have value in the sineStat attributes to set their own value while the changing stats already occupied them. It does not override them either; however, she can still benefit from the additional stats every level."]},{"c":["As Minnah started with ",{"t":"Bloody Tear","r":"weapon:bloody-tear"},", ",{"t":"Whip","r":"weapon:whip"}," is still in the pool of options for level ups. After uniting Bloody Tear with ",{"t":"Vento Sacro","r":"weapon:vento-sacro"}," into the ",{"t":"Fuwalafuwaloo","r":"weapon:fuwalafuwaloo"},", it is able to evolve it into another Bloody Tear. However, they must be united before Whip is maxed out."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Minnah_Mannarah.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Minnah Mannarah's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Minnah_Mannarah.gif","w":112,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Unlock-Minnah_Mannarah.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Unlocks menu icon"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 9 June 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Minnah looks similar to a ",{"i":"Sprite-Werewolf.png","w":23,"h":24}," Werewolf. Its secret unlock menu icon depicts a normal Werewolf."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}